WEBVTT

00:00:00.229 --> 00:00:06.468
A new day in the old capital.

00:00:13.426 --> 00:00:15.014
Cheers!

00:00:16.291 --> 00:00:18.729
-Congratulations, captain.
-Thank you.

00:00:21.226 --> 00:00:25.757
-Congratulations on your last journey.
-Thank you, Candy.

00:00:26.003 --> 00:00:31.342
Thank you, everyone! I will remember
this happiness for a very long time!

00:00:31.631 --> 00:00:33.688
Cheers!

00:00:39.497 --> 00:00:41.118
What a fog!

00:00:41.425 --> 00:00:43.123
It's really cold on the deck.

00:00:43.491 --> 00:00:45.614
And the fog is getting denser.

00:00:49.048 --> 00:00:51.911
I wonder if Stear and Archie are
waiting for me.

00:00:52.359 --> 00:00:55.894
If I'll be together with those two,
any place could be wonderful.

00:01:06.405 --> 00:01:07.558
Somebody is over there.

00:01:18.856 --> 00:01:20.373
Anthony?

00:01:20.411 --> 00:01:25.701
On the deck of a ship heading to London,
Candy was suddenly rendered speechless.

00:01:26.859 --> 00:01:28.155
He looks...

00:01:28.586 --> 00:01:33.302
Anthony... he looks just like him from the back...
almost as if he were disappearing into thin air.

00:01:34.982 --> 00:01:36.429
Impossible...!

00:01:36.897 --> 00:01:39.543
Anthony!
This can't be for real.

00:01:40.473 --> 00:01:42.088
His hair isn't blond.

00:01:42.247 --> 00:01:44.589
And he's taller than Anthony.

00:01:47.526 --> 00:01:48.643
He's crying?

00:02:09.098 --> 00:02:10.730
Is somebody there?

00:02:14.103 --> 00:02:18.801
Yes... I'm sorry, I was going to say something
but you seemed too sad...

00:02:19.269 --> 00:02:23.409
Sad? That's a good one!
Like I was being sad!

00:02:26.283 --> 00:02:29.576
But he really looked as if he was crying.
Maybe I was mistaken.

00:02:31.236 --> 00:02:34.023
No, I wasn't.
I'm sure he was crying.

00:02:34.903 --> 00:02:38.138
Maybe you were daydreaming, miss freckles?

00:02:38.817 --> 00:02:40.289
Miss freckles?

00:02:40.939 --> 00:02:43.308
Hey, aren't you a gorgeous one?

00:02:43.529 --> 00:02:46.574
You probably have a face buried
underneath all these freckles! That's so sad!

00:02:47.231 --> 00:02:50.454
Just for your information,
I happen to like these freckles!

00:02:51.798 --> 00:02:53.639
So that's the reason you have
a whole collection of them.

00:02:53.674 --> 00:02:57.570
Yes, and I want to have even more of them!

00:02:58.003 --> 00:02:59.023
Oh boy...

00:02:59.058 --> 00:03:02.491
Are you jealous because
you don't have any freckles?

00:03:04.677 --> 00:03:07.263
In that case, are you proud
of that flat nose, too?

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:08.952
Of course!

00:03:10.147 --> 00:03:13.339
Miss Candice?
Is Miss Candice over there?

00:03:13.538 --> 00:03:16.496
-Bye, Lady freckles!
-What's up with that!?

00:03:17.188 --> 00:03:20.446
Miss Candice, you're going to
catch a cold if you stay here.

00:03:20.654 --> 00:03:22.961
Say, George, who was he?

00:03:23.523 --> 00:03:25.580
Is mr. Grandchester an acquaintance of yours?

00:03:25.587 --> 00:03:27.962
So his name is Grandchester...

00:03:28.125 --> 00:03:31.000
Yes. He's an English nobleman.

00:03:31.035 --> 00:03:32.981
Nobleman? No way...

00:03:33.410 --> 00:03:34.732
Do you have any business with him?

00:03:34.767 --> 00:03:38.623
No. I thought he looked a bit
like Anthony from behind.

00:03:39.443 --> 00:03:40.816
Like mr. Anthony?

00:03:41.434 --> 00:03:43.451
But it turned out that he's
nothing like Anthony.

00:03:44.225 --> 00:03:47.009
Anthony was... Anthony was...

00:03:47.941 --> 00:03:49.328
...much better than him.

00:03:50.333 --> 00:03:52.483
Miss Candice, please return
to your cabin.

00:03:57.598 --> 00:04:00.647
What a horrible fog.
It feels like I'm in a dream.

00:04:01.187 --> 00:04:05.501
I feel that if I stay out here, Anthony
might suddenly appear before me.

00:04:24.976 --> 00:04:31.094
Mauretania, with Candy on board,
finally landed in Southampton.

00:04:39.649 --> 00:04:42.949
-It's Mauretania!
-Candy's ship!

00:04:42.984 --> 00:04:47.634
-Candy! Candy!
-She can't hear you yet!

00:04:49.474 --> 00:04:51.098
-Candy!
-Alright!

00:04:52.543 --> 00:04:55.200
-Here it is!
-What's that?

00:04:56.018 --> 00:04:57.318
Anyway, look at this.

00:04:58.057 --> 00:04:59.784
Candy!

00:05:00.077 --> 00:05:01.687
I can't hear a thing.

00:05:01.722 --> 00:05:02.637
Candy!

00:05:02.849 --> 00:05:04.212
Candy!

00:05:04.247 --> 00:05:05.344
That's strange.

00:05:05.379 --> 00:05:07.859
Your inventions always end up like this!

00:05:09.287 --> 00:05:11.570
It doesn't work? Now that's strange.

00:05:11.605 --> 00:05:17.644
Candy!!!
Candy!!!

00:05:23.855 --> 00:05:26.657
England!
We've arrived to England, Kurin.

00:05:27.008 --> 00:05:31.921
-Candy!
-Candy! It's me!

00:05:31.956 --> 00:05:35.235
-Archie! Stear!
-Candy!

00:05:36.324 --> 00:05:39.163
I missed them.
They haven't changed at all!

00:06:04.769 --> 00:06:07.350
There she is! Candy!

00:06:07.563 --> 00:06:09.414
-Stear! Archie!

00:06:10.605 --> 00:06:14.093
Candy! It's been a long time!
We missed you so much, Candy!

00:06:14.323 --> 00:06:16.582
Both of you haven't changed at all!

00:06:16.583 --> 00:06:18.218
Candy, you too!

00:06:18.489 --> 00:06:21.837
And now here's one to welcome
Candy to England!

00:06:23.758 --> 00:06:25.240
What's that thing?

00:06:25.390 --> 00:06:27.567
Just look.

00:06:29.378 --> 00:06:30.488
Huh?

00:06:30.731 --> 00:06:34.991
Poor Stear! Why do your inventions
always end up like this?

00:06:35.026 --> 00:06:36.675
Maybe it's stuck...

00:06:36.899 --> 00:06:38.937
The crowd would've gone insane
if you fired the gun!

00:06:39.181 --> 00:06:41.342
Yes, that's right...

00:06:45.655 --> 00:06:47.061
That's strange...

00:06:48.468 --> 00:06:50.103
What's the matter, Candy?

00:06:50.389 --> 00:06:51.449
It's nothing!

00:07:02.712 --> 00:07:05.954
Our carriage is here.
Everyone, this way.

00:07:07.932 --> 00:07:09.384
Let's go, Candy!

00:07:39.817 --> 00:07:42.728
Kurin, that castle looks as if it
came from a fairy tale!

00:07:42.843 --> 00:07:44.849
It's probably a nobleman's mansion.

00:07:44.884 --> 00:07:45.886
Nobleman?

00:07:47.844 --> 00:07:51.039
I wonder if he lives in a place
like this.

00:07:51.376 --> 00:07:55.321
Don't tell me that they own everything
around here.

00:07:55.738 --> 00:07:57.632
What's the matter, Candy?

00:07:58.113 --> 00:07:59.459
It's nothing.

00:07:59.852 --> 00:08:04.165
George, don't tell me that we're
going back immediately.

00:08:04.318 --> 00:08:07.641
We should use this opportunity
to see London a bit.

00:08:07.676 --> 00:08:09.714
We're heading to the zoo.

00:08:09.749 --> 00:08:10.822
Zoo?!

00:08:11.743 --> 00:08:14.895
You've gotta be kidding us!
We're almost adults!

00:08:14.930 --> 00:08:16.846
We'll drop off Kurin.

00:08:17.201 --> 00:08:19.697
George! What's the meaning of this?

00:08:19.923 --> 00:08:23.744
The school you'll be attending
has very strict rules.

00:08:23.957 --> 00:08:25.661
You won't be allowed to keep animals.

00:08:25.696 --> 00:08:27.253
But...!

00:08:28.318 --> 00:08:30.776
Candy, it would be for the better
if you listen to what George said.

00:08:31.027 --> 00:08:35.769
Yeah, they won't let you enter the
St. Paul academy with him around.

00:08:35.804 --> 00:08:39.358
They will inspect all your luggage
at the entrance.

00:08:39.393 --> 00:08:42.661
But why'd you put Kurin in the zoo...?

00:08:44.686 --> 00:08:47.161
The London zoo is the best zoo
in the world.

00:08:47.196 --> 00:08:49.343
I'm sure they will take good
care of Kurin.

00:08:49.497 --> 00:08:52.324
I won't let you put Kurin in the zoo!

00:09:09.607 --> 00:09:10.823
It's him!

00:09:24.476 --> 00:09:28.521
-I'm very sorry.
-Damn it, who gave him a driver's license anyway?

00:09:28.751 --> 00:09:31.477
Kurin! Stear, catch Kurin!

00:09:31.792 --> 00:09:33.758
-Wait, Kurin!
-Candy!

00:09:33.971 --> 00:09:35.450
Miss Candice!

00:09:37.482 --> 00:09:40.593
Wait up, Kurin! Kurin!

00:09:42.131 --> 00:09:43.499
Kurin, wait!

00:09:44.606 --> 00:09:46.433
Kurin, where are you?

00:09:46.982 --> 00:09:49.854
This isn't good.. where did he go?

00:09:49.889 --> 00:09:52.630
He ran away because he thought
I'd put him in a zoo.

00:09:53.176 --> 00:09:54.317
Kurin!

00:09:54.798 --> 00:09:59.423
Kurin, get out!
I won't let anyone put you in a zoo!

00:10:00.162 --> 00:10:02.076
I promise, Kurin!

00:10:09.611 --> 00:10:12.782
Kurin, where did you go?
Come back!

00:10:18.983 --> 00:10:21.861
Kurin?
Kurin, where are you?

00:10:22.361 --> 00:10:23.622
Kurin!

00:10:25.065 --> 00:10:29.530
Kurin, come down.
You and I will be together forever, okay?

00:10:29.712 --> 00:10:31.331
From now on we'll stick together!

00:10:33.254 --> 00:10:36.233
You understand, right?
Come down.

00:10:41.227 --> 00:10:42.726
Wait!
Don't shoot!

00:10:42.761 --> 00:10:44.515
That raccoon is my...

00:10:48.073 --> 00:10:49.620
Kurin!

00:10:54.044 --> 00:10:56.650
*Denjin Anime Fansub*
OMFG IZ-CHAN RESET THE ANIME NOW!!!

00:10:57.132 --> 00:10:59.080
I heard a gunshot from over there!

00:10:59.659 --> 00:11:01.745
Ow.. ouch! Stop that!

00:11:02.210 --> 00:11:03.280
That way!

00:11:03.928 --> 00:11:07.997
That's horrible! What's the matter
with you, shooting such an animal!

00:11:08.180 --> 00:11:10.094
-You're horrible!
-Ouch!

00:11:10.306 --> 00:11:11.100
Don't be unreasonable!

00:11:11.101 --> 00:11:15.232
You're the unreasonable one!
I would have you hanged for this!

00:11:15.267 --> 00:11:17.226
-Candy!
-Candy!

00:11:18.228 --> 00:11:21.203
-You're horrible!
-What happened here, miss Candice?

00:11:24.537 --> 00:11:25.927
Candy?

00:11:26.271 --> 00:11:29.161
He's dead... Kurin was killed!

00:11:33.920 --> 00:11:34.759
Kurin?

00:11:35.182 --> 00:11:36.612
You're the one who fired?

00:11:36.743 --> 00:11:39.889
Yeah... I thought it was a weird raccoon...

00:11:40.777 --> 00:11:42.680
Give him back!

00:11:42.715 --> 00:11:45.607
Give Kurin back!

00:11:51.844 --> 00:11:53.041
Miss Candice?

00:11:54.377 --> 00:11:57.961
George, all of this happened because
you said you'd take him to the zoo...

00:11:58.177 --> 00:12:00.846
There isn't even a single scratch on Kurin.

00:12:00.930 --> 00:12:03.224
Huh? But then...

00:12:04.172 --> 00:12:05.781
You didn't know?

00:12:05.782 --> 00:12:10.435
Raccoons will sometimes play dead
in order to protect their own lives.

00:12:10.874 --> 00:12:13.571
Play dead?
Kurin!

00:12:14.401 --> 00:12:16.705
Kurin, it's me!

00:12:20.389 --> 00:12:23.388
It's true! You're alive, Kurin!

00:12:23.731 --> 00:12:26.773
Now I'll never ever let go of you!
I'm so glad...

00:12:27.892 --> 00:12:32.954
However, miss Candice, even though you say
that, when you enter St. Paul academy...

00:12:32.989 --> 00:12:34.981
Candy, I have a good idea.

00:12:35.016 --> 00:12:37.352
Don't tell me you'll whisk out
one of your weird inventions again!

00:12:37.387 --> 00:12:39.310
Nah, it's not an invention, it's a
brand new discovery!

00:12:39.345 --> 00:12:41.419
Keep Kurin dead, the same way
he was "dead" a minute ago!

00:12:50.440 --> 00:12:52.783
That's Big Ben.

00:12:59.655 --> 00:13:01.347
Wow, it's big!

00:13:01.356 --> 00:13:04.431
Over there is Westminster Cathedral.

00:13:06.788 --> 00:13:08.771
It's high, isn't it?

00:13:11.070 --> 00:13:13.738
This is Trafalgar square.

00:13:14.846 --> 00:13:17.135
That building is the London tower.

00:13:19.148 --> 00:13:21.536
And the London bridge.

00:13:44.200 --> 00:13:46.553
Those soldiers are so cute!

00:13:46.588 --> 00:13:48.865
Candy, let's give it a try here.

00:13:48.900 --> 00:13:50.430
Okay. Kurin!

00:14:02.003 --> 00:14:04.657
Everyone will think that
Kurin is a fur collar.

00:14:04.863 --> 00:14:06.585
Stear, you joker!

00:14:06.796 --> 00:14:09.536
George, now we won't have to
stop at the zoo!

00:14:09.752 --> 00:14:10.954
But...

00:14:10.989 --> 00:14:14.349
If you're worried, why don't we repeat
the test in a more crowded place?

00:14:15.821 --> 00:14:17.779
We'd better head back.

00:14:28.005 --> 00:14:30.822
This is Piccadilly circus.

00:14:31.615 --> 00:14:33.365
So they have a circus here?

00:14:33.584 --> 00:14:34.964
Miss Candice.

00:14:34.999 --> 00:14:39.112
Candy, in England, a "circus" means
a large, circular street intersection.

00:14:39.147 --> 00:14:40.413
Oh well...

00:14:44.084 --> 00:14:46.927
Oh, this is a raccoon collar...

00:14:47.618 --> 00:14:48.886
I see.

00:14:50.002 --> 00:14:53.006
It was really fishy when you
stepped up to explain the collar!

00:14:53.041 --> 00:14:54.561
Uh, maybe so...

00:14:54.596 --> 00:14:57.374
George, let's repeat the test a few times.

00:14:57.576 --> 00:15:00.999
Mr. Stear, we really need to head
back to the school.

00:15:01.034 --> 00:15:04.676
You're always so strict. Candy is
in this town for the first time.

00:15:04.711 --> 00:15:08.846
It's okay with me. I can go
sightseeing whenever I want, right?

00:15:09.399 --> 00:15:10.798
You wish!

00:15:12.279 --> 00:15:16.900
Candy, the two of us are seeing
London for the first time, too!

00:15:17.078 --> 00:15:19.093
But you arrived here two months ago!

00:15:19.801 --> 00:15:22.706
Once you end up in jail, you
don't get out so easily.

00:15:22.936 --> 00:15:25.543
Jail... you mean, St. Paul academy?

00:15:25.544 --> 00:15:29.634
They let you out only when your
family member dies, or something like that.

00:15:29.669 --> 00:15:31.965
Mr. Stear, there's no need for this act.

00:15:32.177 --> 00:15:33.867
They are that strict?

00:15:34.218 --> 00:15:37.635
Candy, if you want to see or do
something, now is the time!

00:15:37.866 --> 00:15:40.678
From tommorrow, a very strict
kind of life awaits you.

00:15:40.880 --> 00:15:43.742
There is someone who is waiting for me.

00:15:43.777 --> 00:15:46.569
Waiting for you?
Here in London?

00:15:47.596 --> 00:15:49.441
Grandfather William.

00:15:49.651 --> 00:15:51.387
Miss Candice!

00:15:53.035 --> 00:15:56.663
It's most unfortunate, but Mr. William
can't see you at this time.

00:15:56.664 --> 00:16:02.076
But it was grandfather William who enabled
me to study in England, right?

00:16:02.111 --> 00:16:05.799
Also, it was him who adopted me
into the Adley family.

00:16:05.834 --> 00:16:09.603
He's always looking so much after me
but I've never got the chance to meet him...

00:16:09.638 --> 00:16:11.586
Actually, it's just like Candy said.

00:16:11.621 --> 00:16:16.255
Come to think of it, even the
two of us never met grandfather William.

00:16:16.256 --> 00:16:17.816
We'd like to see him, too!

00:16:17.851 --> 00:16:20.437
Mr. William currently isn't in London.

00:16:20.472 --> 00:16:25.032
Strange, weren't you planning to return
to America with grandfather William,

00:16:25.033 --> 00:16:26.466
...after escorting Candy to London?

00:16:26.501 --> 00:16:29.282
Mr. William suddenly departed from London.

00:16:29.317 --> 00:16:33.482
George, which hotel is grandfather
William staying in?

00:16:33.692 --> 00:16:37.167
That's right! He must be in Savoy!
The best hotel in London!

00:16:37.957 --> 00:16:39.604
-Let's go!
-Okay!

00:16:39.673 --> 00:16:40.689
Please wait!

00:16:41.534 --> 00:16:44.848
Here!
To hotel Savoy.

00:16:54.938 --> 00:16:59.645
-In which room is William Adley?
-Just a moment.

00:17:00.420 --> 00:17:04.779
William Adley is in apartment 812.

00:17:04.814 --> 00:17:07.513
-Room 812, right?
-Let's go!

00:17:08.476 --> 00:17:09.544
Please wait!

00:17:10.567 --> 00:17:12.816
Kurin, you're heavy, get off!

00:17:13.034 --> 00:17:15.394
-OH MY GOD!!!
-I'm so sorry!

00:17:19.467 --> 00:17:20.432
It's here.

00:17:21.997 --> 00:17:23.553
Room 812.

00:17:29.345 --> 00:17:32.629
Grandfather William?
It's Candy.

00:17:40.052 --> 00:17:41.398
It's open.

00:17:48.096 --> 00:17:52.097
Grandfather William?
It's me, Candice White Adley.

00:17:52.303 --> 00:17:56.120
We came to see you because we thought
it would've been nice to exchange a few words with you.

00:17:58.582 --> 00:18:00.509
Grandfather William?

00:18:01.023 --> 00:18:02.881
Is that a recital?

00:18:06.382 --> 00:18:08.263
So this is our grandfather?

00:18:09.261 --> 00:18:11.838
Impossible!
Who are you?

00:18:15.917 --> 00:18:17.991
The guy who stayed in this room
forgot this.

00:18:20.100 --> 00:18:23.399
Oh, mr. Grandchester, your room is
next to this one.

00:18:23.434 --> 00:18:26.063
I know.
The door was open so I took a peek inside.

00:18:27.764 --> 00:18:31.536
Mr. William abruptly departed
a short time ago.

00:18:31.722 --> 00:18:34.970
All of his luggage will be sent
separately after him.

00:18:35.198 --> 00:18:37.010
But...

00:18:37.460 --> 00:18:41.908
But he wrote this letter to me?
It's from grandfather.

00:18:44.634 --> 00:18:46.150
My dearest Candy,

00:18:46.542 --> 00:18:50.007
There is no need for you to
meet me right now.

00:18:50.042 --> 00:18:52.833
You need to study hard in order
to become a prominent lady.

00:18:52.868 --> 00:18:55.341
However, I'll make sure that
you meet me someday.

00:18:55.376 --> 00:18:57.221
Until that time, William.

00:18:59.933 --> 00:19:01.426
Candy.

00:19:01.827 --> 00:19:04.333
I know, George must have notified
him about our arrival.

00:19:05.137 --> 00:19:07.773
Miss Candice.
Mr. Archie, mr. Stear.

00:19:07.808 --> 00:19:08.666
George!

00:19:09.092 --> 00:19:11.992
Now, miss Candice, let's go.

00:19:12.357 --> 00:19:14.749
Grandfather William...

00:19:29.381 --> 00:19:30.991
Now, Candy, take a look.

00:19:31.026 --> 00:19:34.131
This is our prison, St. Paul academy.

00:19:39.685 --> 00:19:42.834
Now, Candy, Kurin has to stay still
around your neck as a fur collar.

00:19:42.835 --> 00:19:44.774
Now it's for real!

00:19:45.018 --> 00:19:46.013
I understand.

00:19:46.200 --> 00:19:49.107
Kurin, do your best playing dead!

00:19:53.738 --> 00:19:54.671
Miss Candice?

00:20:06.566 --> 00:20:08.500
Candice White Adley, right?

00:20:08.501 --> 00:20:10.035
Y..Yes.

00:20:10.259 --> 00:20:13.105
The director has been waiting for you
for the past three hours.

00:20:13.673 --> 00:20:15.243
Three hours already?

00:20:15.278 --> 00:20:18.719
You've wasted a lot of time
from the time your ship landed ashore.

00:20:20.121 --> 00:20:22.036
I'm sorry.

00:20:23.141 --> 00:20:25.801
And you two, return to boys' ward immediately!

00:20:25.836 --> 00:20:26.691
-Yes!
-Yes!

00:20:26.726 --> 00:20:27.584
Hurry!

00:20:37.978 --> 00:20:41.100
And so, Candy finally landed in jail.

00:20:46.660 --> 00:20:51.260
Candy paused before the gates
of the St. Paul academy.

00:20:52.077 --> 00:20:56.024
They say that this school is the
strictest one in all of England.

00:20:56.059 --> 00:20:59.094
What kind of fate awaits Candy?

00:21:03.722 --> 00:21:04.824
Moreover...

00:21:05.051 --> 00:21:09.441
...just who was the young man whom Candy
met aboard the ship?

00:21:17.111 --> 00:21:20.182
To be continued...
